# Input

```scss
@mixin animation($name){
@keyframes #{$name}{
// Around the content statement.
@content; // After the content statement.
}
}

@include animation(pulse){from{opacity:0;}to{opacity:1;}}
.after-content{color:red;}

```


# Formatted

```scss
@mixin animation($name) {
	@keyframes #{$name} {
		// Around the content statement.
		@content; // After the content statement.
	}
}

@include animation(pulse) {
	from {
		opacity: 0;
	}
	to {
		opacity: 1;
	}
}
.after-content {
	color: red;
}

```
